.TH VERGEBAR 1 "2026-11-10" "vergebar" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vergebar \- high-performance Wayland status bar written in Zig
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vergebar
[\fB\-c\fR \fICONFIG\fR]
[\fB\-s\fR \fISTYLE\fR]
[\fB\-l\fR \fILEVEL\fR]
[\fB\-\-validate\-config\fR]
[\fB\-\-list\-modules\fR]
[\fB\-\-dump\-default\-config\fR]
[\fB\-\-dump\-default\-style\fR]
.br
.B vergebar msg
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS...\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vergebar
is an ultra-fast, lightweight status bar for Wayland compositors (Hyprland, Sway, River, Niri, Wayfire, Mango, KDE KWin) built on GTK4 and gtk4-layer-shell with native Waybar configuration and style support.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fIFILE\fR
Path to the JSONC configuration file. Defaults to \fI~/.config/vergebar/config.jsonc\fR or \fI~/.config/waybar/config.jsonc\fR.
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-style\fR \fIFILE\fR
Path to the CSS stylesheet. Defaults to \fI~/.config/vergebar/style.css\fR or \fI~/.config/waybar/style.css\fR.
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-log\-level\fR \fILEVEL\fR
Set log level (\fIdebug\fR, \fIinfo\fR, \fIwarn\fR, \fIerror\fR).
.TP
\fB\-\-validate\-config\fR
Validate configuration syntax and module structure without launching windows.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-modules\fR
List all available built-in modules.
.TP
\fB\-\-dump\-default\-config\fR
Print default embedded JSONC configuration to standard output.
.TP
\fB\-\-dump\-default\-style\fR
Print default embedded CSS stylesheet to standard output.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print usage help and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Print version information and exit.
.SH IPC COMMANDS
The \fBmsg\fR subcommand sends instant instructions to a running vergebar daemon over a UNIX domain socket.
.TP
.B toggle \fR[\fIBAR\fR]
Toggle visibility of all bars, or a specific bar by name.
.TP
.B hide \fR[\fIBAR\fR]
Hide all bars or a specific bar.
.TP
.B show \fR[\fIBAR\fR]
Show all bars or a specific bar.
.TP
.B reload\fR, \fBreload-style\fR
Reload CSS stylesheet immediately from disk.
.TP
.B reload-config\fR
Reload JSONC configuration and rebuild all bars.
.TP
.B signal \fINUM\fR
Dispatch an update signal to any custom module registered with signal \fINUM\fR.
.TP
.B list-bars\fR
List active bar instances with name, output, position, and visibility state.
.TP
.B quit\fR
Instruct the vergebar daemon to cleanly exit.
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGUSR1
Toggle bar visibility (hide or show).
.TP
.B SIGUSR2
Reload CSS stylesheet immediately from disk.
.TP
.B SIGRTMIN+n
Dispatch an immediate update trigger to any custom module listening on signal \fIn\fR.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vergebar (5)
